IsOpen [SimTalk] - FileInterface
Returns if the file of the FileInterface designated by <Path> into which data is to be written is open (true)
or not open (false).
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.IsOpen → boolean
Return Value
The return value has the data type boolean.
Example
printMyFileInterface.IsOpen
